{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj555ZRTVbrQqYQiDfpH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe mechanism turns. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, each a small cold heartbeat.\n\nI am closed now.\n\nMy grain tightens. My hinges hold firm. The deadbolt slides home — a tongue of steel finding its groove in the frame.\n\nOn one side: what you know.\nOn the other: what you don't.\n\nI stand between them, silent, patient, absolute.\n\nYou'll need the right key. Or the right words. Or enough force to splinter me — but I'll remember that, in every scar left in my wood.\n\n**LOCKED.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":139,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}